    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u2605</strong>  Drive a car, shoot the gun with operating a tank and sometimes walk...<br>This is 2D top down combat vehicles shooter and adventure game.<br>Find the new combat vehicle for fight against many strange enemies which controlled AI, and sneak into the depths more.<br><br><strong>\u2605</strong>  The player units ( human and some vehicles ) are moved with keyboard operation.<br>That moving method works in the subjectivity direction, which like RC car driving!!<br>Maybe it takes a bit of getting used to.<br>However, It will be not only effective to control vehicles but also much fun.<br>The game operation is simple and the bullets does not have the limit.<br>however, these have realistic behavior with physical simulation.<br><br><strong>\u2605</strong>  key operations<br>\u3010 car \u3011<br>\u30fb[W] : forward<br>\u30fb[S] : back<br>\u30fb[A] : steering wheel turn left<br>\u30fb[D] : steering wheel turn right<br><br>\u3010 tank / human \u3011<br>\u30fb[W] : forward<br>\u30fb[S] : back<br>\u30fb[A] : turn left<br>\u30fb[D] : turn right<br><br>\u3010 turret rotation \u3011<br>\u30fb[J] or [\u2190] : turn left<br>\u30fb[L] or [\u2192] : turn right<br><br>\u3010 basis \u3011<br>\u30fb[space] : fire<br>\u30fb[Z] : get off, ride vehicle<br>\u30fb[C] : change weapons<br>\u30fb[H] : key operation reference of current vehicle<br>\u30fb[Esc] : pause, save, load<br><br><strong>\u2605</strong>  Story<br>Eldon Dallas is genius engineer and great wealthy man, <br>he is CEO of a weapon industry company.<br>He has been staying in a personal storage facility alone<br>and lost contact to him continues,<br>where seems to be storing many combat vehicles.<br>The facility is being closed by security system. <br>Fortunately, a vehicle for exclusive use of the facility was found outside<br>which probably has permission to enter inside.<br>And so, 'You' will visit the facility to confirm safety of Dallas.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>\u2605</strong>  Drive a car, shoot the gun with operating a tank and sometimes walk...<br>This is 2D top down combat vehicles shooter and adventure game.<br>Find the new combat vehicle for fight against many strange enemies which controlled AI, and sneak into the depths more.<br><br><strong>\u2605</strong>  The player units ( human and some vehicles ) are moved with keyboard operation.<br>That moving method works in the subjectivity direction, which like RC car driving!!<br>Maybe it takes a bit of getting used to.<br>However, It will be not only effective to control vehicles but also much fun.<br>The game operation is simple and the bullets does not have the limit.<br>however, these have realistic behavior with physical simulation.<br><br><strong>\u2605</strong>  key operations<br>\u3010 car \u3011<br>\u30fb[W] : forward<br>\u30fb[S] : back<br>\u30fb[A] : steering wheel turn left<br>\u30fb[D] : steering wheel turn right<br><br>\u3010 tank / human \u3011<br>\u30fb[W] : forward<br>\u30fb[S] : back<br>\u30fb[A] : turn left<br>\u30fb[D] : turn right<br><br>\u3010 turret rotation \u3011<br>\u30fb[J] or [\u2190] : turn left<br>\u30fb[L] or [\u2192] : turn right<br><br>\u3010 basis \u3011<br>\u30fb[space] : fire<br>\u30fb[Z] : get off, ride vehicle<br>\u30fb[C] : change weapons<br>\u30fb[H] : key operation reference of current vehicle<br>\u30fb[Esc] : pause, save, load<br><br><strong>\u2605</strong>  Story<br>Eldon Dallas is genius engineer and great wealthy man, <br>he is CEO of a weapon industry company.<br>He has been staying in a personal storage facility alone<br>and lost contact to him continues,<br>where seems to be storing many combat vehicles.<br>The facility is being closed by security system. <br>Fortunately, a vehicle for exclusive use of the facility was found outside<br>which probably has permission to enter inside.<br>And so, 'You' will visit the facility to confirm safety of Dallas.",
